      <description><![CDATA[<p dir="auto">Built every night from <code class="notranslate">main</code> (<a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/commit/06043eccbbecba82fb790438d3788f4b6a9b7277/hovercard" href="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/commit/06043eccbbecba82fb790438d3788f4b6a9b7277"><tt>06043ec</tt></a>). Newest features, rougher edges: for the tested version, use the <a href="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/releases/latest">latest release</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Agora Nightly</strong> is a separate app: it installs next to Agora with its own settings and logins, and updates itself to each new nightly.</p>
<h2 dir="auto">Changes</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Update feeds on an 'updates' branch, with a beta channel (<a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/commit/06043eccbbecba82fb790438d3788f4b6a9b7277/hovercard" href="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/commit/06043eccbbecba82fb790438d3788f4b6a9b7277"><tt>06043ec</tt></a>)</li>
<li>README: Agora is in beta; how to open the first time (<a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/commit/55136309ed795cd73fae8bf2bb0c71738cbfee5d/hovercard" href="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/commit/55136309ed795cd73fae8bf2bb0c71738cbfee5d"><tt>5513630</tt></a>)</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">This build isn't notarized: on first launch, open it once, then <strong>System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Open Anyway</strong> (or <code class="notranslate">xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/Agora.app</code>).</p>]]></description>
